    "description": {
      "content": "Public REST API for AlterEstate, the leading real-estate CRM SaaS for agents across Latin America. Exposes property listings, project developments (buildings and units), agents, geographic locations, and inbound lead submission. Read endpoints authenticate with a public API token (aetoken header); lead creation uses an account API key (Authorization: Token).\n\nContact Support:\n Name: AlterEstate Engineering\n Email: engineering@alterestate.com",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
